    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;equal to</p>"
