  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Solving LHS&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, solving RHS&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now equating LHS and RHS we get,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
